<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Evans Withycombe lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Evans Withycombe lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney lowered its recommendation on Evans Withycombe Residential Inc to neutral from outperform, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 21 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
